[{"client_msg_id":"ca675884-dc7a-44fc-a7a3-3539d7f1a207","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"embed使いたくてHEADビルド回してたので続投してしまってる","ts":"1616061584.052600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"manK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1593b6ef-7358-4989-a9dc-a6a2c6ee19ce","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"1.15 だと GO111MODULE=auto なんで、 go.mod がなかったら単に GOPATH になりますね","ts":"1616061572.052100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bp5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"293581b2-d661-49d0-834f-ebb636dfaa57","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"厳密に1.16 stableは試してないので的外れなこと言ってるのかも","ts":"1616061547.051300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7cdb208-a2d7-46a1-b43a-631b0a578e44","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`C:\\` とか `/` に書き換え可能な `go.mod` を置いておくと解決する。 (しない)","ts":"1616061392.050200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"59yr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4fab6fd-1542-40f1-ac39-6077e19209b3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go 1.16 ですか?","ts":"1616061290.049300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ScKVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7596cc46-67ea-4281-85ed-ba39c990b68f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"動いてる","ts":"1616059001.048600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CC56B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74edfbaa-74eb-4da2-b7dd-7bed1a0ce4ae","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"普通にHEADでgo.mod無し動いてる気がするんだけど気のせい？","ts":"1616058937.048300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pbQfb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fede2313-7b94-49e3-b2ba-280cc523cf8e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"依存がstdlibだけで、書いて `go run main.go`  したときに動くかどうか、ですかね?","ts":"1616057886.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ghn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff4d07ee-10a2-4892-ba56-7f27e822ecf3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれうごかないんだっけ?","ts":"1616057821.046700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ATF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8c53126-7e49-4b86-aa3c-751ee42a6fc3","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":":chottowakaru:","ts":"1616057269.046500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vx6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6febe793-4f49-4217-aae1-f08d14776929","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"go mod init hogeがほんのちょっと面倒に感じました。stdlibしか使わないときはgo.mod無しでも動いても良さそうな気がしますが、まあ仕方ないのかな","ts":"1616057201.046200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p41mC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d18dbc10-a59f-4106-af89-8b843e1a5fe3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"main だけのやつは quickrun で実行しちゃうのでなんも気にしてなかった。","ts":"1616055600.042600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cuC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c04046d0-7b29-4b21-9864-a1d6a7d322ad","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`go mod init foo` とか適当にやるだけだし、何の問題も感じてなかった","ts":"1616055241.042000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e0e794b-f5e7-49f0-97a0-5126693414da","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"mainオンリーのコードそんな書きづらい? なんか意識してなかったな…","ts":"1616055001.041500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"akPX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a2f7577-3ba3-4c7f-80e8-4148d322c51a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いまだにdep使ってるのは「え…」という感じするなぁ。go.mod自体はbetaどこか正式リリースされてからかなり時間経ってるし。","ts":"1616054967.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"scajE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4550d1cd-e47a-400f-a0e1-7535a0e78955","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"業務コードだと意外とまだdep使ってるプロジェクトとか有りそう","ts":"1616054852.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zB1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8a52ae8-2ece-4487-a2d6-e5f956822e1e","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"GOPATHから解放されたけどそのぶんgo.mod必須になってmainオンリーのコードをさらさらっと書きづらくなったなあ","ts":"1616054816.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bDFZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d77a5a51-3694-4563-a026-b87452537477","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"アプリに go.mod と go.sum が入ってない場合はその限りじゃないですが…","ts":"1616051730.036100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JEk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"359e86c1-c7e2-41d9-b8d6-1adfe0ecca86","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"了解ですー、ありがとうございます","ts":"1616051434.035600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J245i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0781ebd-e607-4f6f-b93d-499099395396","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"1.15 でも、 go.mod があれば自動的に module モードになるので概ね一緒です","ts":"1616051411.035400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k9fk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad57e0ae-1af8-401e-9fe5-65c518bc8073","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そうですけど、普通最新ので問題ないので最新 (1.16) を仮定しています","ts":"1616051233.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O7U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50f2d00e-b2c3-4c64-91df-557caabb2b3d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なるほど、ありがとうございます\ngoのバージョン次第って感じですかね","ts":"1616051066.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p68oz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"def71f82-eebd-4cec-9709-9039ef63e479","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go modules がもうデフォルトで on になったので、その必要はなくなりました","ts":"1616050994.034000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G6G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c730c2-cde1-4c23-9d1a-3641ae6bad0f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"GOPATH以下にプロジェクト置かないと動作しないみたいなのあったと思うんですけど、それって残ってます？","ts":"1616050977.033600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"07N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96a57f90-3d0d-4519-91f5-7d341952a856","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"デフォルトが $HOME/go で、特に弄る必要はないです","ts":"1616050942.033100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hwuW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"330e7e47-a2f3-430b-881e-e2da93ce282e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"業務で（自分はあまり開発しないんですが）Go触ることになったんですけど、GOPATH関連ってどうなってるんでしょう\n関係なく適当なとこに置いても動くんでしたっけ・・・","ts":"1616050889.032800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oUEl"}]}]
